And from here on, it has a slightly different world view, so I'm nervous to see how it'll turn out,

524
01:32:47,144 --> 01:32:52,144
一緒にこの後も楽しみましょうね！
but let's enjoy the rest together!

525
01:32:53,144 --> 01:32:56,644
